The '''sunfire fanatic chausses''' are an item that requires level 60 [[Prayer]] and 40 [[Defence]] to equip, obtained as a possible reward from participating in the [[Fortis Colosseum]]. Part of the [[sunfire fanatic armour]] set, they provide the [[best in slot]] prayer bonus for the legs slot (+2 over Proselyte), and also have identical defence bonuses to the [[rune platelegs]].

{{Costume storage|armour case|[[Sunfire fanatic armour]] set|set=true}}

{{bug|An incorrect vertex weight can cause some animation stretching on body type B.}}


